  "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.statistic.total_stun": "球体造成的总眩晕时间",
  "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.statistic.total_bounces": "球体弹跳次数",

  "item.relics.jellyfish_necklace": "水母项链",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.description": "像活体装饰品一样缠绕在脖子上，水母即使远离其原生水域也不会枯萎。其半透明的伞状体轻轻脉动，变幻着海水的色调，而细长的触手要么轻轻摇曳，要么收缩，释放出电火花。当佩戴者浸没在水中时，它以自身的力量为代价维持佩戴者的生命和健康。但当敌人靠近时，触手会发出耀眼的放电，电波席卷路径上的一切。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration": "水中再生",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.description": "遗物佩戴者的最大生命值提高 %1$s%%，生命恢复提高 %2$s%%，但仅当其在液体中或雨中时有效。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.rank_modifier.retention": "离开水面后，额外的最大生命值加成将被吸收生命值取代，吸收生命值会随着受到伤害而消耗。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.experience_source.health_regeneration": "每恢复 1 点生命值，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.statistic.health_regenerated": "恢复的生命值",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock": "电击释放",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.mode.enabled": "已启用",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.mode.disabled": "已禁用",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.enabled.description": "每 %1$s 秒积累 1 层电弧充能，最多 %2$s 层。当遗物佩戴者接触到任何活体实体时，消耗 1 层电弧，将 %3$s 格内的所有目标击退，击退强度为 %4$s%%，使其麻痹 %5$s 秒，并触发一条短程闪电链，在 %6$s 格内的附近目标间最多弹跳 %7$s 次，对路径上的一切造成 %8$s 点伤害。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.disabled.description": "能力已禁用，不提供任何加成。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.rank_modifier.conductor": "闪电链对液体中或雨中的目标造成的伤害提高 %9$s%%。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.rank_modifier.charge": "能力触发时，遗物佩戴者在 %10$s 秒内获得用攻击麻痹目标 %5$s 秒的能力。麻痹仅对在当前能力触发期间未被此机制麻痹过的目标生效。",
  "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.experience_source.rings_accumulating": "每生成一层电弧，+1 经验值。",
