  "item.relics.springy_boot": "弹簧靴",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.description": "这只靴子的核心是巧妙设计的弹簧，它们压缩每一步的力量并在适当时机释放，将穿戴者推离任何表面。每次落地都变成一次弹性弹跳，不会对身体造成伤害，但在熟练的手中，可以转化为毁灭性的冲击波。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce": "弹射冲刺",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.description": "蹲跳以 %1$s%% 的力量将遗物佩戴者推向视线相反方向。随后的落地直到完全停止会使遗物佩戴者从水平表面弹起，完全抵消摔落伤害。要强制停止能力效果，只需在落地前按住跳跃或蹲下键即可。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.rank_modifier.disappearance": "使用该能力可获得完全隐身效果，直到下次落地。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.rank_modifier.strike": "在单次使用能力期间，每次从表面弹起都会使造成的伤害提高 %2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.rank_modifier.shockwave": "落地时蹲下会制造一个半径为 %3$s 格的冲击波，造成 %4$s 点伤害并眩晕 %5$s 秒。每个冲击波参数取决于遗物佩戴者在落地时的垂直速度。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.experience_source.bounce": "每完成一次弹跳，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.experience_source.strike": "在跳跃或弹跳期间造成的额外伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.experience_source.create_shockwave": "每个创造的冲击波每增加 1 格半径，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.experience_source.shockwave_hit": "冲击波每击中一个目标，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.bounce_duration": "跳跃和弹跳中的时间",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.primary_bounces": "跳跃次数",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.secondary_bounces": "弹跳次数",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.additional_damage": "跳跃和弹跳中造成的额外伤害",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.shockwaves_amount": "冲击波生成数",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.shockwave_targets": "冲击波击中的目标数",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.shockwave_damage": "冲击波造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.springy_boot.ability.bounce.statistic.shockwave_stun": "冲击波眩晕时间",

  "item.relics.leafy_mantle": "绿叶披风",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.description": "由千片常青树叶编织而成，却轻如正午的树荫，这件披风披在穿戴者肩上，使其成为森林的一部分，躲避窥探的目光。其织物中的树叶脉动着赋予生命的力量，滋养身体，在致命危险时刻，树林本身会奋起防御，用其横扫的枝条格挡任何攻击。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage": "伪装",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.description": "允许在树叶中自由移动，并防止落在树叶上时受到摔落伤害。遗物佩戴者在树叶丛中时，每秒还会恢复 %1$s 点生命值。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.rank_modifier.absorption": "能力触发时，遗物佩戴者获得 %2$s 点额外吸收生命值。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.rank_modifier.disappearance": "遗物佩戴者在能力持续期间获得隐身效果，但与世界的任何互动都会使其移除 %3$s 秒。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.experience_source.hiding": "在树叶丛中每待 1 秒，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.experience_source.healing": "在树叶丛中伪装时每恢复 1 点生命值，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.statistic.hide_duration": "在树叶丛中伪装的时间",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.statistic.heal_amount": "在树叶丛中伪装时恢复的生命值",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival": "树林的馈赠",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.description": "当受到致命伤害时，遗物佩戴者通过吸收半径 %1$s 格内的树叶来避免死亡。吸收的树叶量取决于所受的致命伤害，1 格树叶最多可以抵挡 %2$s 点伤害。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.rank_modifier.piercing": "树叶弹射物造成 %3$s 点伤害，并使路径上的所有目标麻痹 %4$s 秒。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.experience_source.consuming_leaves": "每吸收 1 格树叶，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.experience_source.leaves_impact": "树叶弹射物每击中一个目标，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.leaves_consumed": "吸收的树叶格数",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.damage_negated": "树叶抵挡的伤害",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.damage_dealt": "树叶弹射物造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.paralysis_duration": "树叶弹射物造成的麻痹时间",

  "item.relics.roller_skate": "轮滑鞋",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.description": "看似无害的轮滑鞋，是一位梦想追风的疯狂发明家的遗产。只需一步，轮滑鞋就会带动你向前，积累动量并将其加速到风的速度。在熟练的手中，这种迅捷可以变成一场炽热的舞蹈：一个急转弯，就会有一片致命的火花飞散到地面上，留下一道燃烧的轨迹。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating": "加速",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.description": "持续奔跑时，逐渐提高玩家的移动速度，5 秒后达到最大加成 %1$s%%。随着移动速度的提高，方块滑度也会增加。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.rank_modifier.step_height": "奔跑时的步高增加 %2$s 格。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.rank_modifier.resistance": "随着移动速度的提高，对所受伤害的抗性也会增加，最高可达 %3$s%%。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.rank_modifier.sparkling": "漂移时，会散落火花，根据遗物佩戴者出现时的速度，每单位速度造成 %4$s 点伤害并使目标燃烧 %5$s 秒。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.experience_source.skating": "每滑行 1 秒，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.experience_source.resisting_damage": "通过滑行减免的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.experience_source.creating_sparks": "每创造 10 个火花，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.experience_source.spark_hit": "火花每击中一个目标，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.statistic.distance_traveled": "滑行距离",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.statistic.damage_resisted": "滑行时减免的伤害",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.statistic.sparks_created": "漂移时创造的火花数",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.statistic.damage_dealt": "火花造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.roller_skate.ability.skating.statistic.ignite_duration": "火花造成的燃烧持续时间",

  "item.relics.midnight_mantle": "午夜披风",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.description": "由阴影和星光编织而成，这件披风是早已被遗忘的月神祭司的遗物，他们的力量并非来自月光，而是来自无尽变幻的天空。据说其织物会随月相变化：新月时冷如寂静的夜晚，满月时脉动着深邃的光芒。那些敢于佩戴它的人说，感觉像是成为了在世界间穿梭的黑暗的一部分，其力量随月亮盈亏。他们发誓，面对危险时，披风的反应比他们更快：闪烁的星星从袖中散落，天空以灼热的光芒回应威胁。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase": "月相",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.mode.full_moon": "满月",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.mode.new_moon": "新月",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.full_moon.description": "遗物佩戴者造成的伤害提高 %1$s%%，攻击速度提高 %2$s%%。加成的效果取决于当前月相接近满月的程度。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.new_moon.description": "遗物佩戴者的最大生命值提高 %3$s%%，生命恢复提高 %4$s%%。加成的效果取决于当前月相接近新月的程度。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.rank_modifier.switch": "切换能力模式后 %5$s 秒内，其效果提高 %6$s%%。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.experience_source.damage_dealing": "在满月模式下，根据加成造成的伤害范围内的随机值获得经验。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.experience_source.health_regeneration": "在新月模式下，每额外恢复 1 点生命值，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.duration_new_moon": "模式中的时间",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.duration_full_moon": "模式中的时间",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.additional_damage": "造成的额外伤害",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.health_regeneration": "额外恢复的生命值",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility": "暗影",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.description": "当光照等级低于 %1$s%% 时，将遗物佩戴者笼罩在阴影中，使其隐身。离开阴影后，能力在 %2$s 秒内无法再次触发，并且直到 16 格内的所有目标失去遗物佩戴者的视野前也无法触发。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.rank_modifier.strike": "从阴影中发起的攻击造成的伤害提高 %3$s%%。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.experience_source.being_invisible": "每隐身 1 秒，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.experience_source.damage_dealing": "从隐身状态发起的每次攻击，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.statistic.duration": "隐身时间",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.statistic.additional_damage": "隐身状态造成的额外伤害",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation": "星座",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.description": "受到伤害时有 %1$s%% 的几率向随机方向释放一颗星星，该星星会与 %2$s 格内的其他此类星星合并成星座。穿越星座线会为目标施加震颤效果，持续 %3$s 秒，触碰星星会立即引爆它，对 %4$s 格内的所有目标造成 %5$s 点伤害。星星也会在出现 %6$s 秒后自动爆炸。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.rank_modifier.stun": "星星爆炸还会眩晕目标 %7$s 秒。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.experience_source.star_creation": "每创造一颗星星，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.experience_source.star_tremor": "星座对目标施加的震颤效果每持续 1 秒，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.experience_source.star_damage": "星星造成的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.statistic.total_stars": "星星创造数",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.statistic.star_damage": "星星造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.statistic.star_stun": "星星眩晕时间",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall": "流星雨",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.description": "当遗物佩戴者造成伤害时，有 %1$s%% 的几率从天空召唤一颗流星，落地时产生半径为 %2$s 格的冲击波，造成相当于原始伤害 %3$s%% 的伤害，并眩晕目标 %4$s 秒。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.rank_modifier.bounce": "有 %5$s%% 的几率，坠落的流星会从表面弹起而不被摧毁。每次弹跳冲击波半径减少 1。此效果可多次触发。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.total_stars": "星星创造数",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.experience_source.star_creation": "每创造一颗星星，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.experience_source.shockwave_hit": "星星的冲击波每击中一个目标，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.experience_source.star_bounce": "星星每弹跳一次，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.shockwave_targets": "星星冲击波击中的目标数",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.shockwave_damage": "星星冲击波造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.shockwave_stun": "星星造成的冲击波眩晕时间",
  "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.star_bounces": "星星弹跳次数",

  "item.relics.chorus_staff": "紫颂法杖",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.description": "一根从遥远末地岛屿偷来的奇特紫颂树枝。多年后它仍保留着传送的力量：一挥，身体消失，瞬间出现在另一个未知的地方。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink": "传送",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.description": "使用时，将遗物佩戴者向前传送最多 %1$s 格，消耗内部缓冲区的 1 单位能量，缓冲区共有 %2$s 单位。缓冲区每 %3$s 秒自动恢复 1 单位。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.rank_modifier.safe_fall": "传送后落地不会受到摔落伤害。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.rank_modifier.ascent": "在触及范围内的方块上使用传送会将该玩家传送到该方块上方，而不是向前。如果目标方块上方有其他方块，则使用剩余的传送距离寻找安全位置。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.rank_modifier.flicker": "传送时，附近所有目标会短暂失去对玩家的视野。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.experience_source.blink": "每进行一次传送，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.experience_source.safe_fall": "传送后每安全落地一次，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.experience_source.flicker": "传送期间每有一个目标失去对遗物佩戴者的视野，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.blinks_amount": "总传送次数",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.distance_traveled": "通过传送移动的距离",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.targets": "传送期间失去对遗物佩戴者视野的目标数",
  "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.safe_falls": "传送后安全落地次数",

  "item.relics.piglin_mask": "猪灵面具",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.description": "一件精致的猪灵面部雕刻，诞生于下界。借助它，任何生灵，无论与下界多么格格不入，都能在猪灵中伪装成同类。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality": "中立",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.description": "猪灵不再首先攻击遗物佩戴者。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.rank_modifier.legion": "附近的猪灵会攻击任何试图伤害遗物佩戴者或被遗物佩戴者攻击过的个体。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.experience_source.target": "每次猪灵保护遗物佩戴者时，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.statistic.target": "保护过遗物佩戴者的猪灵数",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter": "以物易物",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.description": "交易时，猪灵会针对单份货币返还最多 %1$s 份交易结果。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.rank_modifier.pocket": "交易前，猪灵可能会立即从遗物佩戴者处收取最多 %2$s 单位货币。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.experience_source.trade": "每次与猪灵交易，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.experience_source.pickup": "猪灵每多拾取 1 单位货币，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.statistic.currency": "与猪灵交易花费的货币",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.statistic.items": "与猪灵交易获得的物品",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting": "战利品",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.description": "击杀目标会掉落额外的金牙。其数量取决于目标的最大生命值，每 %2$s 点生命值有 %1$s%% 的几率掉落一颗金牙。金牙可用于与猪灵交易或熔炼成金锭。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.rank_modifier.frenzy": "在 %3$s 秒内拾取掉落的金牙，每拾取一颗会使伤害提高 %4$s%%，攻击速度提高 %5$s%%。拾取新的金牙会刷新效果持续时间。当拾取的金牙数量达到 32 颗时，后续拾取不再刷新持续时间，而是使所有加成翻三倍，直到时间结束。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.experience_source.drop": "每掉落一颗金牙，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.experience_source.stack": "从金牙获得的每层充能，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.teeth_dropped": "从目标身上掉落的金牙数",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.teeth_picked_up": "拾取的掉落金牙数",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.additional_damage": "金牙效果下造成的额外伤害",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.effect_duration": "金牙效果下的时间",
  "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.tripled_effect_duration": "三倍金牙效果下的时间",

  "item.relics.cut_glass_boot": "切割玻璃靴",
  "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.description": "由一位疯狂的玻璃吹制匠打造，他试图将海洋囚禁在多面容器中。这只靴子由多层水晶雕刻而成，记忆着每一滴曾经触及它内壁的液体。随着时间的推移，玻璃不再仅仅储存液体，而是学会了控制液体：一旦靴子被填满，水、熔岩、毒药或任何其他液体的表面在穿戴者脚下会硬化，像一座镜像桥梁。",
  "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass": "玻璃",
  "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass.description": "当手持遗物时，其功能类似于普通桶，能够储存最多 %2$s 种液体，总体积为 %1$s mB。要切换当前选择的液体，请手持遗物，按住 Shift 并滚动鼠标滚轮。当装备遗物时，它允许在内部缓冲区中存储的任何液体上移动。在液体上的移动速度减半，但每有 1000 mB 的同种液体，在其上的移动速度提高 %3$s%%。",
  "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass.experience_source.standing": "在液体上每移动 1 秒，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass.statistic.duration": "站在液体上的时间",

  "item.relics.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins": "七宗罪之戒",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.description": "曾经，这枚戒指是封印对一位堕入自身恶习的国王所作判决的工具。七颗水晶镶嵌在其戒托中，每颗都蕴含着国王一项致命罪孽的印记，热切地对佩戴者灵魂中哪怕最细微的罪孽迹象做出反应。水晶燃烧得越亮，佩戴者的身体和意志就越强——但代价也随之增长：好运变为损失，胜利变为重伤，救赎变为需向坟墓偿还的债务。长期持有这枚戒指的人说，随着时间的推移，它会停止服从主人——而正是佩戴者自身的弱点决定了谁将继承罪孽的力量。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.statistic.unequip_attempts": "尝试取下戒指的次数",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.pride": "傲慢",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.pride.description": "遗物佩戴者对目标每拥有 1 格垂直高度优势，造成的伤害提高 %1$s%%，但对目标每处于 1 格垂直高度劣势，受到的伤害也会提高。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.pride.experience_source.height_advantage": "佩戴者与目标之间的高度差造成的额外伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.pride.statistic.additional_damage": "高度差造成的额外伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.pride.statistic.damage_received": "高度差造成的额外受到伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.envy": "嫉妒",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.envy.description": "目标当前生命值每比遗物佩戴者高出 5 点，造成的伤害提高 %1$s%%。如果目标生命值低于佩戴者，则受到的伤害提高 %2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.envy.experience_source.health_gap": "因目标与遗物佩戴者之间的生命值差异而改变的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.envy.statistic.offensive_shift": "生命值差异造成的额外造成伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.envy.statistic.defensive_shift": "生命值差异造成的额外受到伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath": "暴怒",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.description": "命中时，开启一个持续 %1$s 秒的伤害窗口：开始时伤害提高 %2$s%%，到窗口中间时恢复到基础值，之后到窗口结束时降低至 %3$s%% 的惩罚。发起新的攻击会重置窗口。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.experience_source.timing": "在时机窗口内改变的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.statistic.windows": "创建的伤害窗口数",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.statistic.bonus_damage": "时机窗口内造成的加成伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.statistic.reduced_damage": "时机窗口内减免的伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.sloth": "懒惰",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.sloth.description": "站立不动 %1$s 秒可使遗物佩戴者获得无敌状态。然而，移动时，每单位速度会使受到的伤害提高 %2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.sloth.experience_source.immortality": "每次进入静止无敌状态，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.sloth.statistic.immortality_duration": "静止无敌状态下的时间",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.sloth.statistic.damage_from_moving": "移动时受到的额外伤害",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.greed": "贪婪",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.greed.description": "幸运值提高 %1$s，战利品产出提高 %2$s，但有 %3$s%% 的几率摧毁遗物佩戴者获得的战利品。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.greed.experience_source.ore": "每挖掘一个矿石方块，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.greed.experience_source.mob": "每击杀一个生物，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.greed.experience_source.nullification": "每次完全无效化的战利品掉落，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.greed.statistic.nullified_tables": "无效化的战利品掉落数",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.gluttony": "暴食",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.gluttony.description": "当饥饿值高于一半时，遗物佩戴者的所有属性每点饥饿值提高 %1$s%%；低于一半时，所有属性每点饥饿值降低 %2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.gluttony.experience_source.food": "消耗的食物每恢复 1 点饥饿值，+1 经验值。",
