  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.gluttony.statistic.negative_duration": "负向饥饿修正下的时间",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.lust": "色欲",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.lust.description": "繁殖动物最多可产生 %1$s 只额外后代，但被繁殖的动物会在 %2$s 秒内死亡，除非再次繁殖。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.lust.experience_source.offspring": "每产生一只额外后代，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.lust.statistic.extra_offspring": "产生的额外后代数",
  "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.lust.statistic.breeding_attempts": "进行的繁殖尝试次数",

  "item.relics.sphere_of_self_sacrifice": "自我牺牲之球",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.description": "这个球体既非金属也非玻璃锻造而成——它是由比祈祷更轻柔、比判决更沉重的誓言编织而成。在内部，浑浊外壳之下，一抹深红缓缓滚动，仿佛一颗异界的心脏在寻找主人的节奏。他们说，这件遗物的真正持有者不再畏惧死亡，并非因为他们不朽，而是因为他们学会了与不可避免之事本身讨价还价——押上自己的鲜血，赢得本不应存在的几秒钟。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice": "牺牲",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.description": "使用时，消耗玩家最大生命值的 33%，并在接下来的 10 秒内恢复两倍于此的生命值。最多可同时存在 %1$s 个生命恢复效果。重复使用该能力会重置所有活跃生命恢复效果的持续时间。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.rank_modifier.resistance": "每有一个活跃的生命恢复效果，受到的伤害减少 %2$s%%。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.rank_modifier.salvo": "蹲下时右键会取消所有活跃的生命恢复效果，将其作为追踪血弹射向前方的目标。每颗血弹造成的伤害等于其对应效果尚未恢复的剩余生命值。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.rank_modifier.salvation": "如果生命恢复效果数量未达到上限，且受到的伤害超过该能力造成的伤害，则伤害减少至该能力的伤害值，并使当前生命恢复效果数量增加 1。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.experience_source.self_inflicted": "每次激活能力，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.experience_source.resisting_damage": "生命恢复效果减免的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.experience_source.salvation": "以触发能力为代价无效化的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.statistic.healing_done": "生命恢复效果恢复的生命值",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.statistic.damage_resisted": "生命恢复效果减轻的伤害",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.statistic.projectiles_created": "发射的血弹数量",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.statistic.blood_projectile_damage": "血弹造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.statistic.salvation_triggers": "以激活能力为代价的伤害减轻触发次数",
  "relics.description.sphere_of_self_sacrifice.ability.sacrifice.statistic.salvation_damage_blocked": "以激活能力为代价减轻的伤害",

  "item.relics.hunting_belt": "狩猎腰带",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.description": "这条腰带曾被那些学会不仅依靠自己双手，也依靠伙伴尖牙的猎人所佩戴。磨损的皮革和骨头饰品保存着数十场共同战斗的记忆。腰带加强了主人与其宠物之间的联系，将它们变成一支致命的群体。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.slots": "军械库扩展",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.slots.description": "最大护符装备数量增加 %1$s。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack": "群体",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.description": "遗物佩戴者的宠物造成的伤害提高 %1$s%%。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.rank_modifier.leader": "半径 %2$s 格内的宠物，每只可使遗物佩戴者受到的伤害减少 %3$s%%，最多 5 只宠物。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.rank_modifier.relentless": "遗物佩戴者的宠物无视目标的无敌帧。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.rank_modifier.revival": "宠物死亡时，会掉落一个特殊的骨头，可通过击杀生物充能。每击杀一个生物，骨头的充能值增加相当于该生物最大生命值的量。复活宠物的花费为其最大生命值的 %4$s%%。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.experience_source.pet_damage": "遗物佩戴者的宠物每次攻击，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.experience_source.pet_resistance": "基于宠物的佩戴者保护吸收的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.experience_source.bone_drop": "从倒下的宠物身上每创造一个骨头，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.pet_attacks": "宠物攻击次数",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.pet_damage": "宠物造成的伤害",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.damage_resisted": "基于宠物的保护吸收的伤害",
  "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.pet_bones": "从倒下的宠物身上创造的骨头数",

  "item.relics.rider_flute": "骑手之笛",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.description": "这个看似简单的笛子常被那些一生中大部分时间都在马鞍上度过的游牧民和信使携带。它的声音对骑乘动物来说比任何缰绳都更熟悉：一声信号将它们召唤到主人身边，另一声则让它们耐心等待时机。随着时间的推移，笛子获得了一种奇怪的名声，仿佛它可以将动物的身体和灵魂锁定，直到骑手再次需要上路。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable": "马厩",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.description": "右键点击一只驯服的骑乘动物，将其放入笛子内。再次右键点击可释放动物，并可通过再次右键点击将其召回笛子。要完全将动物从笛子中释放，你必须在潜行时右键点击。笛子最多可同时存放 %1$s 只骑乘动物，你可以在潜行时滚动鼠标滚轮在它们之间切换。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.rank_modifier.regeneration": "为存放在笛子内的所有骑乘动物每秒恢复 %2$s 点生命值。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.rank_modifier.recall": "如果被释放的骑乘动物移动到距离其主人超过 16 格的位置，它会自动返回笛子。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.rank_modifier.resistance": "当遗物持有者骑乘从笛子中召唤的坐骑时，持有者和动物对受到的伤害都获得 %3$s%% 的抗性。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.experience_source.riding": "骑乘笛子中的坐骑每移动 25 格，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.experience_source.healing": "笛子内的骑乘动物每恢复 1 点生命值，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.experience_source.recall": "每次骑乘动物自动返回笛子，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.experience_source.resistance": "骑乘召唤的坐骑时格挡的伤害每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.statistic.distance_traveled": "骑乘笛子中的坐骑移动的距离",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.statistic.captured_mounts": "放入笛子的骑乘动物数",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.statistic.released_mounts": "从笛子释放的骑乘动物数",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.statistic.healed_health": "为笛子内的骑乘动物恢复的生命值",
  "relics.description.rider_flute.ability.stable.statistic.damage_resisted": "骑乘笛子中的坐骑时格挡的伤害",
  "relics.message.rider_flute.slot": "[%1$s/%2$s]：%3$s",
  "relics.message.rider_flute.deployed_suffix": " [已释放]",

  "item.relics.clot_of_time": "时间凝块",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.description": "这个凝块看起来像一滴冻结的宇宙，其深处缓慢旋转着过去时刻的碎片。据说它出现在时间曾经破裂的地方。在遗物持有者手中，凝块允许他们短暂地逆转时间，仿佛沿着尚未消退的痕迹抹去自己的错误。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind": "逆行",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.description": "按住右键时，将遗物持有者沿最近走过的路径平滑地回溯时间，最多 %1$s 秒。回溯结束后，能力进入冷却，冷却时间等于不间断连续使用遗物的时间。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.rank_modifier.invulnerability": "在回溯期间，遗物持有者不会受到伤害。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.rank_modifier.health_rewind": "在回溯期间，将生命值恢复到路径上对应时间点的数值，但绝不会降低当前生命值。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.rank_modifier.oblivion": "当能力激活时，附近所有实体失去对遗物持有者的视野。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.experience_source.rewind": "在回溯模式中每度过 1 秒，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.experience_source.health_rewind": "生命回溯修正恢复的生命值每增加 1 点，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.statistic.activations": "遗物激活次数",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.statistic.rewind_duration": "回溯模式中的时间",
  "relics.description.clot_of_time.ability.rewind.statistic.health_restored": "生命回溯恢复的生命值",

  "item.relics.chef_hat": "厨师帽",
  "item.relics.raw_meatball": "生肉丸",
  "item.relics.cooked_meatball": "熟肉丸",
  "relics.description.chef_hat.description": "这顶帽子曾属于一位厨师，他的宴会不仅聚集了国王，还有从战场归来的战士。据说他不仅能养活饥饿的人——他还能将战斗的热度转化为食物，即使在死亡边缘也能恢复力量。帽子的白色织物早已吸收了烟雾、香料和沸腾大锅的气味，其褶皱似乎保存着数百顿在冲突间隙匆忙准备的饭菜的记忆。每当这件遗物的持有者击败敌人时，帽子会慷慨地奖励他们战利品，将倒下的血肉变成简单而丰盛的食物。",
  "relics.description.chef_hat.ability.satiety": "肉丸收获",
  "relics.description.chef_hat.ability.satiety.description": "击杀目标有 %1$s%% 的几率掉落 1 个肉丸，其性质与生牛肉相同，可以食用或烹饪以获得更多营养。",
