  "item.relics.glitchy_mantle": "故障斗篷",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.description": "遗物佩戴者周围的空间开始出现故障，仿佛现实中出现了错误：打击偏离目标并落空，脚下的空气短暂变得坚固，允许他们走到本不存在路径的地方，而故障的复制品出现在佩戴者周围，类似于错误加载的他们存在的痕迹。",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.ability.distortion": "感知故障",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.ability.distortion.description": "针对遗物佩戴者的攻击有 %1$s%% 的几率落空。",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.ability.distortion.rank_modifier.disorientation": "当攻击落空时，攻击的目标转向随机方向并失去对遗物佩戴者的视线。",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.ability.distortion.experience_source.miss": "每次攻击落空于遗物佩戴者，+1 经验值。",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.ability.distortion.statistic.misses": "引发的落空次数",
  "relics.description.glitchy_mantle.ability.illusion": "故障复制品",
