  "relics.description.ghostly_mantle.ability.gaze.statistic.damage_bonus": "充能提供的加成伤害",
  "relics.description.ghostly_mantle.ability.spectral_escape": "虚无逃脱",
  "relics.description.ghostly_mantle.ability.spectral_escape.description": "每 %1$s 秒一次，取消致命伤害，使遗物佩戴者进入虚无飞行状态并获得无敌效果，持续 %2$s 秒。",
  "relics.description.ghostly_mantle.ability.spectral_escape.rank_modifier.reprisal": "造成致命伤害的生物将从遗物佩戴者的下一次攻击中受到 %3$s%% 的额外伤害。",
